-- Article 9 (paying premiums: allocation, top-ups, holidays, grace, lapse, reinstatement)
-- and Article 10 (currency).
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of ../../source/raw/manulife-maxx.txt.
-- The numbers 9.2 to 9.5 stand on their own lines (src 299-303, 356), away from their text.
--
-- PERIODS. "60 ngày", "hai (02) năm": the document never says calendar or working days;
-- they are read as calendar days and years, and a period "from" a day is counted from the
-- next day, its last day being the corresponding date (NOTES.md fork register, counting).

§ `Article 9 — Paying premiums`
-- src:277 | ĐIỀU 9  THANH TOÁN PHÍ BẢO HIỂM

§§ `9.1 Regular basic premium`

-- The regular basic premium in the Schedule is payable for as long as the Life Insured
-- lives. Inert as a rule here: the due dates are the Schedule's, and Article 20 ends the
-- contract at age 99.
-- src:278 | 9.1
-- src:280 | Phí Bảo hiểm Cơ bản Định kỳ …

-- After the first premium, a regular premium not paid on or before its due date counts as
-- not paid, unless a premium holiday under 9.3 applies.
