-- The allocated basic premium buys units in the funds, in the allocation's proportions, at
-- the offer price on the next Valuation Date immediately after the transaction effective
-- date. A top-up (9.2) is bought the same way. The prices are computed by Article 11.2 from
-- each fund's valuation on that day.
