§§ `9.2 Top-up premiums`

-- While the contract is in force the Policyholder may invest more by paying a top-up. The
-- allocated top-up buys units in the funds the Policyholder names, at the offer price on the
-- next Valuation Date after the transaction effective date. The conditions are Annex 2 B.
