        `in force`
    AND `the policy year in which` `the date of the request` `falls, for a contract effective on` `the effective date` AT LEAST 2

-- A delay without notice: every rider ends "immediately after the grace period"; the main
-- contract stays in force subject to Article 20. In the first policy year the grace period
-- is the 60 days of 9.4 after the due date. From the second policy year a missed premium
-- opens no grace period (9.4, src 364-367), so the paragraph has nothing to count from
-- (NOTES.md, findings).
