    THEN `the day after the grace period of a premium due on` `the due date`
    ELSE `from the second policy year a delay in premiums opens no grace period, so Article 9.3 does not say when the riders end`

-- A holiday with notice: every benefit continues; the rider premiums are taken from the
-- surrender value at the bid price. Whenever the surrender value cannot meet the monthly
-- risk premium, policy fee AND rider premiums, the riders end and the surrender value meets
-- only the risk premium and policy fee. When it cannot meet those, the grace period of 9.4
-- begins. "không đủ" (not enough) is read as strictly less than.
