GIVEN `the account` IS A `The account at a monthly deduction`
GIVETH A `The contract at a monthly deduction`
`Article 9.3 — the contract at a monthly deduction during a notified premium holiday, given` `the account` MEANS
    BRANCH
      IF `the account`'s `surrender value` LESS THAN `the account`'s `risk premium` PLUS `the account`'s `policy fee`
         THEN `the grace period of Article 9.4 begins`
      IF `the account`'s `surrender value` LESS THAN `the account`'s `risk premium` PLUS `the account`'s `policy fee` PLUS `the account`'s `rider premium`
         THEN `the riders end, and the surrender value meets only the risk premium and policy fee`
      OTHERWISE `the deductions are met, riders included`

