GIVEN `the day the grace period began` IS A DATE
      `a sufficient payment received`  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The end of a grace period from the second policy year`
`Article 9.4 — the end of a grace period that began on` `the day the grace period began` `, a sufficient payment being received:` `a sufficient payment received` MEANS
    IF   `a sufficient payment received`
    THEN `the contract continues, a sufficient payment having been received`
